sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Admin
    participant Ctrl as AdminJobsController
    participant Guard as PermissionsGuard
    participant Svc as AdminJobsService
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Q as BullMQ Queues
    participant Audit as AuditService

    Admin->>Ctrl: GET /admin/jobs?status=&queue=
    Ctrl->>Guard: Check admin_jobs.read
    Guard-->>Ctrl: Allowed
    Ctrl->>Svc: listJobs()
    Svc->>Q: Inspect queues by name from queue-names.ts
    Svc->>DB: Read OutboxEvent/related state
    Svc-->>Ctrl: Job references (ids/metadata, no large payload dumps)
    Ctrl-->>Admin: List
    Note over Svc: Unreachable queue must not fail listing
    Admin->>Ctrl: POST /admin/jobs/:id/discard
    Ctrl->>Guard: Check admin_jobs.manage
    Ctrl->>Svc: discard(id)
    Svc->>DB: Update OutboxEvent status = DISCARDED
    Svc->>Audit: audit admin.job.discarded
    Admin->>Ctrl: POST /admin/jobs/:id/requeue
    Ctrl->>Guard: Check admin_jobs.manage
    Ctrl->>Svc: requeue(id)
    Svc->>DB: Reset attemptCount=0, status->PENDING, clear error/deadAt
    Svc->>Q: Re-enqueue
    Svc->>Audit: audit admin.job.requeued
    Note over DB: DISCARDED kept (not deleted) for audit/history
    Note over Svc: Read vs manage permissions are separate
